      <h3 class="major">Who we are</h3>
      <p>This website is operated by <strong>Braddell Heights II Toastmasters Club</strong> (Club No. 7511), a member club of Toastmasters International, meeting at Braddell Heights Community Centre, 1 Braddell Rise, Singapore 579716.</p>
      <p>We are committed to handling personal data responsibly and in accordance with Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act 2012 (PDPA).</p>

      <h3 class="major">Data we collect directly</h3>
      <p>This website does not collect, store, or process any personal data directly. There are no account registrations, newsletter sign-ups, or contact forms on this site.</p>
      <p>If you contact us by email at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>, your email address and message content will be used solely to respond to your enquiry. We do not share this information with third parties.</p>

